    "input": "search_document: I understand this is a stressful situation, especially with your family waiting. Based on the handbook excerpts provided, here is the information regarding your issue:\n\n1.  **Delivery Timeframe:** The handbook states that digital gift cards are delivered via email within 15 minutes of completing your purchase [gift_cards_delivery]. Since it has been many hours, this is outside the standard delivery window.\n2.  **Lost or Stolen/Undelivered Cards:** The handbook section on \"Lost or Stolen Cards\" states that digital gift cards are tied to your email address and can be re-sent to your inbox upon request [gift_cards_lost_stolen]. It also notes that we cannot replace a digital card if it has already been redeemed, but since you do not have the code, it has likely not been redeemed.\n3.  **Action Required:** The handbook does not provide a self-service link to \"check my account\" or manually trigger a resend from this chat interface. It explicitly states that for issues involving lost/stolen cards (which can apply to undelivered codes if the system thinks it was sent), you should **contact customer support immediately** [gift_cards_lost_stolen].\n\n**Important Note:** The handbook excerpts provided do not contain instructions for an in-store agent to manually override a payment or for me (the AI assistant) to access your account, verify your receipt, or manually send the code to your email. My capabilities are limited to answering questions based on the provided text.\n\n**Recommendation:**\nSince you are physically in the store and the handbook indicates that digital cards can be re-sent upon request to customer support [gift_cards_lost_stolen], you should immediately speak to a **human store associate or customer support agent** at the point of sale. They will have the tools to verify your purchase receipt and trigger the re-send of the digital gift card code to your email, as this action requires account access and manual intervention not covered by the general policy text provided to me.\n\nI am unable to access your account or send the code directly. Please escalate this to a human agent at the store immediately to resolve the payment block.",
